WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.800
Internal notes are for the team.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:06.547
Add a short record of your follow-up, then save it.

00:00:06.597 --> 00:00:11.468
The note stays with the enquiry, together with its author and time.

00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:15.508
This makes it easier to pick up the conversation later.
